  ///    client. If not available, the key type defaults toALL.
  ///    - TLS_JA4_FINGERPRINT: JA4 TLS/SSL fingerprint if the
  ///    client connects using HTTPS, HTTP/2 or HTTP/3. If not available, the
  ///    key type defaults to ALL.
